 in  the world or do I quit my job and start  this weird life coaching business where  I don't even believe myself kind of but  I can't deny it sounds awesome and so I  really thought about I said I got to do  this and I quit my job and I decided to  start my own business 23  if you want more Murray check that the  first top-10 I made on her the link is  right there next to me I think you'll  enjoy it continue to believe and I'll  see you there when I was bartending I  was fully bartending like I wasn't  talking to myself about oh my god I  should be dancing right now or I should  be working on my coaching practice while  I was growing my personal coaching  practice
 

